OL,3,GNEWSAWildfires came 'worryingly' close
OL,4,Ato animal sanctuary
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity has described how wildfires
OL,7,Fcame "worryingly" close to its rescue
OL,8,Fcentre.
OL,10,FInternational Animal Rescue, based in
OL,11,FEast Sussex, told the BBC its
OL,12,Fconservation project in Borneo has been
OL,13,Fimpacted by wildfires sweeping across
OL,14,FIndonesia.
OL,16,F"When the fires really got a grip, they
OL,17,Fcame worryingly close to our rescue
OL,18,Fcentre - literally within a few hundred
OL,19,Fmetres," said the charity's chief
OL,20,Fexecutive Gavin Bruce.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
